    text: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 552cd24dca2d17643afbd89e937ffba8, type: 2}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: ...who comes... to the drowned bell...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4715ce8bb449f349a824f2a81701ffc1, type: 3}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: ...silence... yes... rest now...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7feb1485e87f28dd985d8c5506a24293, type: 3}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 1
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: Will you wake it?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options:
    - text: I will ring it.
      condition: {fileID: 0}
      hideWhenUnavailable: 0
    - text: Let it sleep. Let the marsh keep its silence.
      condition: {fileID: 0}
      hideWhenUnavailable: 0
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: ...then find its tongue... the clapper the water stole...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 595b2b7b7b126edad9fa73eebec8295a, type: 3}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 3
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fb7b684f5e9afe019b15177a78021b99, type: 2}
    options: []
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: ...silence... yes... rest... the marsh will forget us...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06d697d926f774c859a7766b43403abf, type: 3}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 2
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 850520e0be842c7e9830bf255c4a9069, type: 2}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: The toll... and the shrine's light... I can see the way out. I am free.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 78e921dd4a8fb3b5bada1980e9487956, type: 3}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
  - kind: 0
    speaker: 
    speakerEntityId: 
    text: The toll... it hurts... but the village will sleep. I will stay with the
      bell.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fbd57a72a76e74bac8f90c0a55281aaa, type: 3}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    condition: {fileID: 0}
    actions: {fileID: 0}
    options: []
